  testTitle:"Words from our community",q1:"\"I opened the box and my kitchen smelled like my childhood in Medellín.\"",q2:"\"My kids finally understand what I mean when I say 'a taste of home'.\"",q3:"\"The family pack was gone in one weekend with the cousins. Ordering again.\"",
  promoTitle:"Welcome offer: 10% off your first order",promoText:"Use this code at checkout and join our list for new flavors, holiday boxes and Colombian traditions.",emailLabel:"Email",join:"Join",joined:"Thank you! Check your inbox soon.",
  faqTitle:"Frequently asked questions",
  f1q:"Where do you ship?",f1a:"We ship to addresses across the United States. Delivery times appear at checkout.",
  f2q:"Are Quimbayas really made in Colombia?",f2a:"Yes. Every pack is a Colombian product, selected to preserve the flavor you remember.",
